Assertions:
[NEG] /account/returns does NOT answer 404 and does not redirect to the account dashboard; it renders the returns list or its empty state {SPEC}
[DOM] the account sidebar entry reads "Returns" (or the localized localized equivalent) {SPEC}
[DOM] /account/notifications renders (a 404 here means the Push Messages module is absent: ONLY the notification assertions of later cases are BLOCKED) {SPEC}
[EVIDENCE] OBSERVED in run REG-2026-10-01-2133: /account/returns renders the returns list (columns RMA, Date, Status, Qty), the account sidebar entry reads "Returns" and /account/notifications renders with the Return push messages. A 404 on /account/returns or a missing Returns entry means the theme or the Return module is not deployed/enabled for the store ("Return module" OFF) - report the suite BLOCKED naming the miss; it is not a product FAIL. {OBSERVED}

